WEBVTT

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:02.980
<b>A golden sky</b>

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:04.980
<b>is stained red</b>

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:07.360
<b>at the hour
of sunset.</b>

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:13.400
Get out of here by yourself!

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:16.120
There's nowhere to run!

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:17.850
And...

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:21.830
I refuse to run and leave you here.

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:27.710
Tch... so they're starting to synchronize?

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:32.010
Shuuyu, go!

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:23.580
Great, Shuuyu!

00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:25.960
You're moving a lot better!

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:29.120
The spiritual power is increasing, too!

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:30.430
<i>So that's it...</i>

00:02:30.430 --> 00:02:33.790
<i>Depending on her lord,
she can get even stronger!</i>

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:40.470
Looks like luring us to an 
open location was a bad move.

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:43.760
Hakkejin! Tou!

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:52.230
Wh-What is this light?

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:53.480
No!

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:55.350
We're locked in here?

00:02:56.090 --> 00:02:57.440
Damn it!

00:02:57.440 --> 00:02:59.240
We're trapped!

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:03.240
Monkeys must be locked in cages!

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:10.780
Oh no!

00:03:10.780 --> 00:03:12.700
Shuuyu can't move around like before!

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:19.080
Gien!

00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:21.630
I've trapped her for you.

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:23.970
Get serious.

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:28.140
I can handle the likes of Shuuyu as I am.

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:31.240
I, your lord, shall make 
that decision for you.

00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:32.980
If you're not going to listen to me,

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:36.110
it's back to that empty world for you.

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:38.980
So you're a slave of a stupid lord?

00:03:40.210 --> 00:03:43.540
You were once the general of three armies!

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:48.290
It seems you are no longer 
the Gien I once knew.

00:03:50.050 --> 00:03:52.000
A stupid lord?

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:53.290
Then...

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:56.890
How good is your own?

00:03:56.890 --> 00:03:58.590
Show me!

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:05.760
<b>Bui</b>

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:08.390
That's right.

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:21.880
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:23.280
<i>At this rate...</i>

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:24.320
<i>I have to do something!</i>

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:36.830
Enough, Gien.

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:41.170
If you kill her, I won't 
be able to steal her card.

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:46.760
Sh-Shuuyu!

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:51.270
Are you okay?

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:52.750
Yeah.

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:54.320
I'm not done yet.

00:04:54.320 --> 00:04:56.600
Come here, Shuuyu.

00:04:57.230 --> 00:05:00.320
I'll make better use of you.

00:05:00.930 --> 00:05:02.390
Don't make me laugh.

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:04.820
Who would ever join you?

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:06.360
Never!

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:09.390
You're just a card.
Don't talk to me like that.

00:05:09.390 --> 00:05:13.020
Gien, chop off an arm!

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:18.520
It seems the twilight really does hate me.

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:19.840
Twilight...

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:21.590
This light...

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:24.410
Here he comes!

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:26.460
Get back!

00:05:26.460 --> 00:05:27.680
Wait!

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:28.970
I lose!

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:31.930
What? It's too late for that.

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:33.560
I'll give you the card.

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:37.140
So please don't hurt Shuuyu.

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:40.720
Do you know what you're saying?

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:41.520
Yeah.

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:44.730
If I'm killed in battle, 
it doesn't bother me.

00:05:44.730 --> 00:05:45.630
But...

00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:47.150
It's the only way.

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:48.890
Very well.

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:52.990
But we'll need Shuuyu to 
show her loyalty to me,

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:55.750
her new lord.

00:05:56.180 --> 00:06:00.960
Shall I have you take his head while I watch?

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.280
I can't...

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:14.350
Y-You can't mean to...

00:06:14.630 --> 00:06:18.640
In the end, I'm betrayed by my own lord?

00:06:19.800 --> 00:06:21.770
Then I'll do what you want,

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:24.230
and chop off your head!

00:06:25.180 --> 00:06:26.320
That's right.

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:30.090
You don't want to waste your chance.

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:32.530
Tell me one thing before I die, Chou-sensei.

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:34.490
What is this stuff

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:37.080
about Kentei's heart?

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:38.600
Very well.

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:43.250
I'll give you a class on the 
Soul Buster before you die.

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:46.130
Soul Buster?

00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:48.920
It's the name of a cursed game

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:51.640
in which we devour each other's Souls.

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:57.230
Do you remember what happened 
in this country in 220 A.D.?

00:06:57.230 --> 00:06:59.560
It was the end of the Kan dynasty...

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:02.700
Emperor Kentei lost his throne,

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:06.570
and he held a ceremony 
to restore the dynasty.

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:11.340
But there was a traitor 
hidden among his advisors.

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:15.080
That was probably the 
one who gave you a card.

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:19.160
You mean the famous Suikyou-sensei 
was an advisor to Kentei?

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:22.810
Suikyou took the heart from Emperor Kentei

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:25.500
and hid it somewhere in this country.

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:28.380
For the next 1800 years,

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:31.720
the Emperor has sought his heart.

00:07:33.070 --> 00:07:35.710
So that wasn't just a dream.

00:07:35.710 --> 00:07:36.540
That's right.

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:39.640
You broke the seal on the heart.

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:42.880
What does Kentei want?

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:45.150
Why are you after me?

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:49.770
The Emperor's wish is to 
bring back the Kan dynasty.

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:52.360
The return of his heart 
was just the first step.

00:07:52.650 --> 00:07:56.120
Now history is starting to 
change, little by little.

00:07:56.640 --> 00:07:59.740
So that's why the <i>Romance of 
the Three Kingdoms</i> disappeared

00:07:59.740 --> 00:08:01.120
from the history books?

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:07.580
But it seems that Suikyou has gathered 
allies and intends to interfere again.

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:11.450
So I'm going to kill you.

00:08:11.450 --> 00:08:12.720
Now, Shuuyu,

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:15.640
take his head!

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:24.600
I thought I'd finally found 
someone worthy to be my lord.

00:08:26.420 --> 00:08:28.730
Yes, that's right.

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:34.890
Shuuyu, our twilight...

00:08:36.060 --> 00:08:37.490
isn't over yet!

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:42.540
What?

00:08:43.730 --> 00:08:44.650
Now!

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:55.510
Retsuouken!

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:58.680
<b>Retsuouken</b>

00:09:14.210 --> 00:09:17.660
S-So you made the very sun your ally?

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:19.800
S-Splendid...

00:09:31.280 --> 00:09:33.240
Is Chou-sensei okay?

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:36.130
He just used all his spiritual 
power and passed out.

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:39.470
Then once he wakes up 
he'll come after us again?

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:41.180
Don't worry.

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:45.830
He's lost his memories of when he was a lord.

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:47.660
When a general is defeated,

00:09:47.660 --> 00:09:50.400
all memories of the cards vanish.

00:09:50.850 --> 00:09:54.000
Those are the rules of this bloody game.

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:55.640
Once you lose your cards,

00:09:56.290 --> 00:09:57.980
you lose your memories, too?

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:01.960
It's nothing.

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:03.960
I'm just tired.

00:10:04.550 --> 00:10:06.160
Still...

00:10:07.090 --> 00:10:10.890
I had no idea the setting 
sun was so beautiful.

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:14.560
Tell me something.

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:15.920
That plan you had...

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:19.060
I could have betrayed you.

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:21.340
Didn't that worry you?

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:25.310
If you really are Shuuyu,

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:27.690
there's no reason to doubt, is there?

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:33.740
You're a good-for-nothing, but a bold one.

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:36.630
I hate this game.

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:39.400
And I hate being called a good-for-nothing.

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:41.740
I didn't want

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:45.240
to be chosen by someone like you, either.

00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:49.640
I will be going, then.

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:50.310
Yeah.

00:10:55.140 --> 00:10:56.630
Sheesh...

00:10:57.920 --> 00:11:00.200
What a day!

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:01.620
Come to think of it...

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:04.250
Chou-sensei's cards!

00:11:09.030 --> 00:11:09.850
Ryou'un?

00:11:10.360 --> 00:11:11.640
What are you doing here?

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:24.890
No way...

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:26.910
You, too?

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:29.910
<b>Twilight</b>

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:03.310
A storm gathers suddenly.

00:13:03.310 --> 00:13:05.120
A light bursts through the clouds.

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:06.920
A rain of arrows slices through the wind.

00:13:06.920 --> 00:13:08.380
The silence bursts,

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:11.650
and a messenger of destruction 
comes from the horizon.

00:13:11.650 --> 00:13:13.000
Fallen and lost,

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:14.680
the path darkens,

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:17.110
and they strike, as the rain falls.

00:13:17.510 --> 00:13:19.540
Next time: "Disaster."
